# D3-EN-007: Add fresh protein after a protease incubation
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 40mL
add v1 gelatin 0.25g
add v1 protease 0.05g
add v2 water 40mL
add v2 gelatin 0.25g
wait 1h
inspect
add v1 gelatin 0.25g
add v2 gelatin 0.25g
wait 1h
look v1
look v2
inspect
